  "id": "inattentional-blindness",
  "term": "inattentional blindness",
  "definition": "Inattentional blindness is failing to notice a clear, unexpected event because attention is focused somewhere else. It describes a limit of attention in which people can miss something visible even when it seems obvious in hindsight.",
